  "description": "Proposed construction of a rear roof dormer extension to facilitate additional habitable space within the loft of a private residential flat and enlargement of existing roof window and introduction of new roof window to front roof slope ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "Prior to occupation, at least one bird/bat box shall be provided close to the eaves and shall be retained thereafter.&nbsp;REASON: In the interests of improving biodiversity. ",
    "&lt;p&gt;All new external facing and roofing materials in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works carried out in this connection) shall match those of the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance including type, size, colour, bond, pointing, coursing, jointing, profile and texture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-9df68596-7fff-874e-2f59-903d246aaa0a&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;REASON: To ensure that the external appearance of the building is satisfactory and does not detract from the character and visual amenity of the area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>"
